  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING\n\t\t\t* The Facts of a class that read the outcome before anything else share one run, in declared order. A Fact that sets up or mentions a value first, and each Theory row, still runs alone\n\t\t\t* A Fact that changes what a later Fact reads — consumes a stream or a lazy enumerable, changes the subject — now affects it: give it a class of its own\n\t\t\t* A shared run's Until steps and disposal happen after the class's last Fact\n\t\t\t* The specification document lists a class's requirements in declared order\n\t\t\t* ThatProtected is removed: That(member) reaches a protected member too\n\t\t\tADDED\n\t\t\t* A Fact that fails on a shared run but passes alone says so in its test output",
